&lt;h1&gt;In a nutshell&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the intelligence that helps households get the week sorted&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic grocery assistance:&lt;/strong&gt; Picnic brings together something unusually powerful for an AI builder: a direct customer relationship, a live grocery assortment and the operational system that takes every order from intention to delivery. That gives you the opportunity to build an assistant that does more than talk; it can understand a household’s plans and constraints, assemble a grounded basket, explain its choices and learn from what customers accept or change. You will decide where models, retrieval, ranking and deterministic services add real value, balancing customer control, correctness, latency, reliability and cost.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical leadership &amp;amp; vision: &lt;/strong&gt;As a Staff AI Engineer, you will be the hands-on technical lead for Agentic Shopping. You will own technical direction, architecture and model-strategy decisions; solve the hardest production challenges yourself; and establish evaluation, observability, safety and fallback patterns that other teams can reuse.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build Picnic’s shopping assistant:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the technical direction for agentic shopping experiences that help millions of people plan and shop effortlessly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical leadership &amp;amp; architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the system architecture for multi-turn conversational agents, balancing latency, safety guardrails, and inference costs. Technically mentor engineers across the organization to execute on building production-grade agentic systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rapid prototyping &amp;amp; productionization:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive a fast-paced, iterative engineering cadence. Build initial prototypes, establish architectural patterns, and write production code when necessary to unblock complex technical challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Model fine-tuning &amp;amp; context engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Design and implement systems architectures for multi-turn, conversational agents using open-weight models and techniques like fine-tuning, distillation, and RAG.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evaluation &amp;amp; safety feedback loops:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish continuous offline and online evaluation for mission completion, basket correctness, customer effort, clarification quality, acceptance and corrections, safety, reliability, latency and cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with product, design, and product teams to define technical trade-offs, align on agent capabilities, and ensure a seamless, safe user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;We’re looking for&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of taking complex multi-turn conversational AI systems from architectural design to high-scale production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience training, fine-tuning, and optimizing open-weight LLMs for production deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on expertise building production RAG systems, context management, and state handling for multi-turn dialogues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing robust evaluation loops, continuous monitoring systems, and automated safety/guardrail mechanisms for customer-facing applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead technical direction, perform design reviews, and mentor engineering teams without relying on hierarchy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Python skills and demonstrated ability to choose and productionize appropriate model, orchestration, retrieval, evaluation and inference tooling. Experience with tools such as PyTorch, LangGraph, vLLM, Pydantic AI, Qdrant or DeepEval is useful, or similar framework tools is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;+ Bonus points!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience taking retrieval, ranking or recommendation models from problem definition to measurable production impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth expertise in deep learning for sequence modelling, representation learning, or retrieval and ranking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A degree in Computer Science, AI (or a related field), a PhD, open-source contributions, or peer-reviewed research are considered strong pluses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Picnic Perks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🫱🏼‍🫲🏾 Teamwork makes the dream work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With more than 80 nationalities across 3 countries, you’ll be part of a diverse company with plenty of cool stuff to get involved with, from board game evenings to after-work drinks to our company ski trip and more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💡 Make a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work in an awesome startup environment with the freedom to drive your own projects and create a visible impact. Our fully electric vehicles and sustainable business model mean you’ll also be contributing to making the world a better place!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🥗 Fresh Lunch, coffee, and snacks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our offices are equipped with fully-fledged coffee bars and a kitchen and chefs. They prepare delicious fresh and warm lunches every day so you can keep your energy up.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚲 Health insurance discount &amp;amp; bike plan&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have a partnership with CZ (a health insurance provider). Picnic employees get a discount on CZ insurance packages between 5% and 15%. Furthermore, through our partnership with Lease a Bike, you can rent-to-own a new (e)bike at a discounted rate&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌎 Relocation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re moving from another country to join Picnic we make it as smooth as possible for you. We’ll cover your flight costs for you and your partner and kids, your first month&#39;s rent and moving costs (up to €2000), and help you with the 30% tax ruling setup and application.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;📆 All the rest&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic you get 25 holidays, we cover your travel expenses and offer a pension plan. And your phone and laptop are on us, as well.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In a nutshell&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a developer working with Salesforce and Python, you&#39;ll join the Master Data team. We own the product data everything else runs on — from integrating supplier catalogues, through enrichment and validation, to what a customer sees in the app and what the warehouse needs to plan how a product fits in a tote. Hundreds of colleagues work with the platform every day, handling large volumes of master data across multiple countries, and your job is to make that easier — a validation that catches a bad value before it reaches a customer, a screen that stops taking eight clicks to do one thing. You&#39;ll solve data issues and steadily improve the platform. Over time the role grows towards software engineering, deeper into Python and data platform architecture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Take ownership of a part of the platform, know it well, and grow into the person others come to for it. You&#39;ll propose improvements rather than waiting for them to be assigned, and you try things and iterate quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Maintain and extend:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, test, evolve, and refine the core aspects of our master data platform with a creative and analytical approach. Keep it healthy by improving existing flows and integrations while reducing complexity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data modeling and quality: &lt;/strong&gt;Shape how product information is modeled, and build the validation, enrichment and monitoring that keeps it accurate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work with your users: &lt;/strong&gt;Build relationships with the operational teams who work daily with the platform, understand their pain points, and turn those into improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Code Review:&lt;/strong&gt; Review designs and code of teammates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Support existing products and work with other developers to resolve incidents, including occasional on-call shifts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technologies we use&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salesforce: Apex, LWCs, RESTful integrations, Salesforce Connect&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deployments: Salesforce DX &amp;amp; Unlocked Packages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IDEs: VSCode, Intellij; scratch orgs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python: FastAPI, Pydantic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data: SQL, Snowflake, dbt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Version Control: Git, Github&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CI/CD: TeamCity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s Degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering or a related quantitative field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience with Salesforce implementations including Apex&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious and detail-oriented: you pick things up fast, including technologies new to you, like Python or dbt, and you have the patience to chase an inconsistency until you understand where it came from. Using AI tools effectively in your daily work is good evidence of both&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuinely interested in data and the people who depend on it — models, quality, what happens downstream&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid judgement on tradeoffs between configuration and custom code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Applies software engineering best practices to Apex/LWC development e.g. triggers, async apex, testing, access and data lifecycle management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;English skills are on point (no Dutch required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bonus Points!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good command of Python/Java&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with master data, product data management or data engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of DX and unlocked packages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with sharing and security setups of Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salesforce Certifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Picnic Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;✍🏼Every expert was once a beginner!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get plenty of opportunities to challenge yourself and grow, including the Picnic Tech Academy, Lunch &amp;amp; Learn sessions, and tailored soft skills training. We also offer free professional weekly language courses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💡Make a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work in an awesome startup environment with the freedom to drive your own projects and create a visible impact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our fully electric vehicles and sustainable business model mean you’ll also be contributing to making the world a better place!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🫱🏼‍🫲🏾Teamwork makes the dream work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With more than 80 nationalities across 3 countries, you’ll be part of a diverse company with plenty of cool stuff to get involved with, from board game evenings to after-work drinks to our company ski trip and more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🍎You are what you eat&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get freshly prepared, healthy lunches and snacks (with plenty of vegetarian, vegan, and halal options). Coffee snob? Don’t worry, our amazing Picnic barista has you covered.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🚴🏽Stay healthy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mental health is important. As well as having the option to speak with Picnic colleagues who act as confidential advisors, our collaboration with OpenUp gives you easy access to professional psychologists, along with workshops and materials.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There are plenty of sports communities and events to get involved with, from tennis to yoga, to climbing!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔋Attractive package&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer competitive compensation and a pension plan that looks out for your future self, as well as 25 vacation days per year, so you can recharge your batteries&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌍Benefits for expats&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It can be daunting starting a new job AND moving to a new country. That’s why we offer lots of support for our many expat colleagues, including:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Relocation package: If you join Picnic from abroad, we’ll cover your trip to Amsterdam, sponsor your Visa, and offer you a month of accommodation while you settle in (as long as regulations allow).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the Netherlands, we offer support with your first tax report as well as arranging the 30% ruling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From health insurance to living arrangements to pet passports, there are always colleagues who’ve faced the same challenges and are more than happy to help!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;10yxk9z&quot; data-start=&quot;438&quot; data-end=&quot;460&quot;&gt;In een notendop&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;16&quot; data-end=&quot;436&quot;&gt;Picnic is op zoek naar een SEO Specialist met een passie voor het optimaliseren van websites voor betere vindbaarheid in zoekmachines. Je begrijpt de complexiteit van technische SEO en hebt de drive om impactvolle verbeteringen door te voeren. Werk je graag in een internationaal team en krijg je energie van het laten groeien van de Picnic-website tot hét belangrijkste customer acquisition kanaal? Lees dan snel verder!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;10yxk9z&quot; data-start=&quot;438&quot; data-end=&quot;460&quot;&gt;Kunst van het vak&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;462&quot; data-end=&quot;1611&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;30fy0l&quot; data-start=&quot;462&quot; data-end=&quot;628&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;464&quot; data-end=&quot;496&quot;&gt;SEO-strategieën ontwikkelen:&lt;/strong&gt; Ontwikkel en implementeer SEO-strategieën gericht op het vergroten van organisch verkeer en het verbeteren van zoekmachineposities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;mmgn5y&quot; data-start=&quot;629&quot; data-end=&quot;793&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;631&quot; data-end=&quot;649&quot;&gt;SEO-onderzoek:&lt;/strong&gt; Voer diepgaand keyword research uit om kansen te identificeren en ervoor te zorgen dat content optimaal aansluit op zoekintentie en relevantie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;gpzsvu&quot; data-start=&quot;794&quot; data-end=&quot;964&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;796&quot; data-end=&quot;829&quot;&gt;Technische SEO-optimalisatie:&lt;/strong&gt; Analyseer en verbeter de technische aspecten van onze website, zoals sitestructuur, crawlbaarheid, indexeerbaarheid en paginasnelheid.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;h8grj4&quot; data-start=&quot;965&quot; data-end=&quot;1142&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;967&quot; data-end=&quot;990&quot;&gt;Nauwe samenwerking:&lt;/strong&gt; Werk intensief samen met webdevelopers en UX/UI-designers om technische SEO-verbeteringen door te voeren en best practices voor websites te waarborgen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;d70vk6&quot; data-start=&quot;1143&quot; data-end=&quot;1327&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1145&quot; data-end=&quot;1170&quot;&gt;Contentoptimalisatie:&lt;/strong&gt; Werk samen met het contentteam om content te optimaliseren en implementeren voor zoekmachines, zonder concessies te doen aan merktoon en gebruikerservaring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;syg1b8&quot; data-start=&quot;1328&quot; data-end=&quot;1488&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1330&quot; data-end=&quot;1357&quot;&gt;Performance monitoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Gebruik SEO-tools om prestaties te monitoren, keyword rankings te volgen, backlinks te analyseren en verbeterkansen te signaleren.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14cnp8b&quot; data-start=&quot;1489&quot; data-end=&quot;1611&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1491&quot; data-end=&quot;1506&quot;&gt;Rapportage:&lt;/strong&gt; Stel regelmatig rapportages op over organische zoekprestaties en adviseer over optimalisatiestrategieën.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;1tfla33&quot; data-start=&quot;1613&quot; data-end=&quot;1634&quot;&gt;Jouw superkrachten&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1636&quot; data-end=&quot;2617&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;u5nfnb&quot; data-start=&quot;1636&quot; data-end=&quot;1710&quot;&gt;Afgeronde MSc. opleiding in Marketing, Bedrijfskunde, Analytics of vergelijkbaar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qxwo9p&quot; data-start=&quot;1711&quot; data-end=&quot;1784&quot;&gt;Tot 2 jaar ervaring als SEO Specialist binnen een customer-facing merk en internationale omgeving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1y799c2&quot; data-start=&quot;1785&quot; data-end=&quot;1908&quot;&gt;Diepgaande kennis van technische SEO, waaronder sitestructuur, crawl management, structured data en mobile-first indexing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;mzaapm&quot; data-start=&quot;1909&quot; data-end=&quot;2015&quot;&gt;Hands-on ervaring met SEO-tools zoals Google Analytics, Google Search Console, SEMrush en Screaming Frog&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1gsspkt&quot; data-start=&quot;2016&quot; data-end=&quot;2119&quot;&gt;Vermogen om technische wijzigingen zelfstandig op websites door te voeren (ervaring met CMS-systemen)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1g2tstw&quot; data-start=&quot;2120&quot; data-end=&quot;2198&quot;&gt;Vloeiend in Nederlands en Engels; kennis van Frans of Duits is een grote pré&lt;/li&gt;
