&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In a nutshell&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic, we run some of Europe’s most advanced automated grocery fulfilment centres, combining robotics, smart software, and a people-first culture. As Continuous Improvement and Operations Manager in our Maintenance Value Stream, you own the long-term strategic direction and continuous improvement of all material handling equipment on site. Working closely with the Site Manager, cross-functional engineering teams, and operational leaders, you translate high-level site goals into scalable improvement roadmaps, optimizing automated workflows while fostering operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on leadership: &lt;/strong&gt;Lead the Maintenance value stream day-by-day, coaching Maintenance Engineers and Supervisors to effectively lead their teams and ensuring equipment availability targets are met with indirect leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Value Stream Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Define and execute the long-term performance roadmap, taking full ownership of structural strategy and high-level KPIs across safety, quality, throughput, and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuous Improvement &amp;amp; Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead site-wide Kaizen initiatives, Lean methodologies, and root-cause analyses to drive structural process enhancements and embed a culture of continuous improvement. Data-Driven Process &amp;amp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation Optimization: &lt;/strong&gt;Analyze complex operational and maintenance workflows using data to eliminate bottlenecks, boost system reliability, and improve equipment availability alongside technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Strategic Alignment: &lt;/strong&gt;Act as the strategic bridge between maintenance, our suppliers, planning, analysts, and operations to ensure seamless, end-to-end operational flow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Standards &amp;amp; Governance:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee site-wide adherence to safety standards, 5S principles, and operational best practices without getting bogged down in daily engineering management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master’s degree (MSc) in Supply Chain Management, Engineering, or a related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience focused on maintenance, operational strategy, continuous improvement, or process engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interest in, or exposure to, automation, robotics, and facility maintenance systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in applying Lean, Six Sigma, or Kaizen frameworks in high-volume, automated environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High analytical proficiency, with strong capability in data analysis tools (e.g., Tableau, Excel, SQL).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic mindset with the ability to influence cross-functional teams and drive high-level initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English (Dutch is a strong plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Picnic perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll receive a competitive compensation package, including 25 vacation days per year to recharge your batteries&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The option to lease a car&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll get freshly prepared, healthy breakfast, lunches (and dinner at the FC) as well as delicious snacks and drinks available at all Picnic locations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A flexible company pension plan called “Doenpensioen” at a.s.r.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Picnic laptop and smartphone&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An awesome scale-up atmosphere with the freedom to drive your own projects and the opportunity to have an impact!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The chance to work in an international environment with motivated team members &amp;amp; legendary company events&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Many internal learning and development possibilities as well as professional soft skill &amp;amp; leadership trainings at a specialized external party&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have Fulfilment Centres across The Netherlands in the following locations: Utrecht, Ridderkerk, Berkel en Rodenrijs, Dordrecht, Eindhoven, Zwolle, Heerenveen, Geldermalsen&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
