&lt;h2 class=&quot;entry-intro&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;entry-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/djJ0q6231tI?feature=shared&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;entry-intro&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;entry-intro&quot;&gt;In a nutshell&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;group/conversation-turn relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;flex-col gap-1 md:gap-3&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;flex max-w-full flex-col flex-grow&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;min-h-[20px] text-message flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 whitespace-normal break-words [.text-message+&amp;amp;]:mt-5&quot; data-message-author-role=&quot;assistant&quot; data-message-id=&quot;266e3a10-dc9a-4829-b84e-6cf8d3c0f2e0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert light&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Recruitment team plays a crucial role in finding top talent worldwide and persuading them to join Picnic. If you have excellent communication skills, thrive on identifying the right profiles, and know how to get candidates excited about unique challenges, we want to hear from you! Understanding the profiles we seek is key, as finding the right people is vital to our success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will take full ownership of your fulfilling roles, organize recruitment initiatives and source the best talent out there. If you are proactive, solution-driven and excited to grow our business, we’d love to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is &lt;strong&gt;not &lt;/strong&gt;a support role - it’s an entry point into Talent Acquisition. Our goal is to build a lasting partnership. We’re eager to consider high-performing interns for full-time roles to continue shaping Picnic&#39;s future together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Tricks of the trade&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;: You&#39;ll work closely with our recruiters and various internal teams to understand the specific requirements for open positions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sourcing&lt;/strong&gt;: Using LinkedIn Search and other search techniques, you&#39;ll actively look for potential candidates and approach them to explore opportunities at Picnic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;: You will design and execute creative strategies to build robust talent pipelines, taking full ownership of the search for unique talent while aligning with broader team goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: You&#39;ll bring fresh ideas and provide valuable input to enhance our talent pipeline processes and improve overall recruitment outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For example, every year at Picnic we organize a Business Course event for potential Analyst candidates (see video &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyQh6HZ_Pgo&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;). In 2026, it could be YOU the one recruiting for it, together with the support of our colleagues.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;Your superpowers&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are currently enrolled in a Master’s programma in Psychology, HRM, Business Administration or similar fields&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have prior internships or working-student experience, preferably in active sourcing or recruiting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills in English and German&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are available for 40 hrs p/w, for a minimum of 4 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have EU citizenship (mandatory)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Note: this is a regular internship opportunity (no thesis internship or project internship)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Picnic, we use Greenhouse as our ATS. It&#39;s great if you&#39;re familiar with it or if you&#39;re curious to learn!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Picnic Perks&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-info-section&quot;&gt;🚀&lt;strong&gt;Every expert was once a beginner!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You’ll get plenty of opportunities to challenge yourself and grow, including Lunch &amp;amp; Learn sessions, and tailored soft skills training.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-info-section&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-info-section&quot;&gt;🌍&lt;strong&gt;Make a difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;You’ll work in an awesome startup environment with the freedom to drive your own projects and create a visible impact. Our fully electric vehicles and sustainable business model mean you’ll also be contributing to making the world a better place!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-info-section&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-info-section&quot;&gt;🤝&lt;strong&gt;Teamwork makes the dream work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;With more than 80 nationalities across 3 countries, you’ll be part of a diverse company with plenty of cool stuff to get involved with, from board game evenings to after-work drinks to our company ski trip and more!&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-info-section&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-info-section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🥗Fresh Lunch, coffee, and snacks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-info-section&quot;&gt;Our offices are equipped with fully-fledged coffee bars and a kitchen and chefs. They prepare delicious fresh and warm lunches every day so you can keep your energy up.&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-info-section&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-info-section&quot;&gt;💪&lt;strong&gt;Stay healthy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Mental health is important. As well as having the option to speak with Picnic colleagues who act as confidential advisors, our collaboration with OpenUp gives you easy access to professional psychologists, along with workshops and materials.&lt;br&gt;There are plenty of sports communities and events to get involved with, from tennis to yoga to climbing!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-info-section&quot;&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;section vacancy-detail-info-section&quot;&gt;💰&lt;strong&gt;Attractive package&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We offer €800 per month gross salary for a full-time internship, along with a laptop and phone to support your work. Travel costs can also be reimbursed, depending on your location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Always wanted to build the systems behind one of Europe&#39;s most advanced supply chains? As part of this Graduate Program, you&#39;ll own part of Picnic&#39;s supply chain tech products from day one. You&#39;ll be end-to-end responsible for developing products that power our operations by understanding operational challenges, analyzing data, working with business teams, designing solutions with engineers, and validating impact through experiments and analytics. You&#39;re the one making it happen. The program at Picnic is one of the most ambitious tracks in the industry: from recent graduate to Product Manager. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Wondering what problems you’ll work on? Think optimising how items are picked in our automated fulfilment center, decreasing waste by optimal ordering, designing a flow how we make sure coolpacks for chilled deliveries get back to the fulfilment center or integrating with robots to automate our operations even more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over 18 months you&#39;ll learn everything it takes to build a great product by actually doing it. You&#39;ll work alongside experienced product managers in our team. You will spend your program embedded deeply in one supply chain domain to see the long-term impact of your products, with options to expand scope into adjacent domains as you scale after 18 months. Every 3 months, you will reflect on your growth and define new learning goals with your mentor to grow you into the Product Manager role as fast as possible.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;0-6 months&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You learn how to solve operational and internal user problems. From day one, you’ll help build features used by thousands of users, while getting to know our product end to end. To understand what to build, you’ll analyze operational processes through data analysis and interviews. Based on your learnings you’ll help shape new features.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6-12 months&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You build your first features from scratch. This is the first time you&#39;ll own the full product development lifecycle. With the help of an experienced Product Manager, you’ll scope a supply chain problem, shape the solution across design, engineering, data, and business. You’ll drive execution on your plan, ship to customers &amp;amp; see the direct impact of your work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;12+ months&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You own a product scope end to end. You decide what problems to solve and own the solutions: the research, the analyses, the designs, the stakeholders, the tech. You are in the lead and responsible for the outcome.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Program&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The launchpad to Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt;. Learn everything there is about building product &amp;amp; become a PM twice as fast as the industry standard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership from day one&lt;/strong&gt;. You’ll immediately work on improving our Supply Chain, alongside our experienced product teams. You’ll get to experience different scopes ranging from warehouse operations to ordering inbound and from optimal planning of deliveries and routing to our in-house built apps used by thousands of our operational colleagues.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tangible impact&lt;/strong&gt;: Every feature you ship is measured, so you&#39;ll see the exact impact of your decisions in real data. If it works, double down. If it doesn&#39;t, own it and iterate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentorship&lt;/strong&gt;: You&#39;ll have a dedicated mentor accelerating your growth. Your mentor will grow you as a Product Manager, and also be your guide into the domain. But most of what you learn, you learn by actually doing it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who are you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for future leaders who are hungry to learn, eager to build, and passionate about our mission. You don’t need years of product management experience, but you do need to show us you have the raw talent and drive to succeed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Master&#39;s degree in a quantitative field like Econometrics, Engineering, Computer Science, or similar. Recent graduate or up to two years of professional experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builder at heart. You&#39;ve taken initiative and created something from scratch, whether that&#39;s a side project, a new idea, or your own startup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly ambitious, natural curiosity and empathy for users. You want to understand, you&#39;re always asking &quot;why&quot;, and you always think about how to make things better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Go-getter personality. You&#39;re biased toward action and constantly pushing toward clarity and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
